# 28 October 2026 : Build ZenRayCar Delivery Candidate v635
# EN: Multi-seam hermetic weld pack:
#     1) Rear Diffuser Lower Corners to Tail Face (CAR_body_tail_face_C to CAR_diffuser_rear_C):
#        2 contact vertices sealed flush at 0.00 mm at X = +-0.44 m, Y ~ 0.165 m, Z = -2.100 m, closing 7.10 to 7.21 mm gaps.
